{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は\n寧々の主演映画『杉沢村都市伝説』\nの完成披露・舞台挨拶イベントでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愛未と一緒に\n寧々の応援してきました(*゜▽゜)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"映画怖かった(*_*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ストーリーもおもしろかったし\nなんと言っても寧々が可愛かった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/06/23/8464755/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん見てください(*゜▽゜)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホラー3部作の一番最後！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/06/23/8464755/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/06/23/8464755/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台挨拶にちょっと慣れてきたところで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後なのか～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寂しい(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも楽しかったな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったみなさん\n本当にありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/06/23/8464755/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/06/23/8464755/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ルービックキューブね\nちょうどあのとき乃木團のベースの練習を\nすごい頑張ってた時だったから\n指に水ぶくれできてただけだよ～！\n大丈夫です(*゜▽゜)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/06/23/8464755/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"知ってるとゆーか\nメチャハイの物販で何回かお会いしてる～(*°-°*)\nステージではまだ見たこと無いから\n定期公演とか行きたいな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/06/23/8464755/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々に質問返し＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も１日頑張ろう`・ω・´"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}